title: A District Says No
subtitle: One district leadership will not call its members out.
new-page: true
tags: event
view-if: crisis_march = 1 and crisis_time = 2 and e21_refuse_done = 0 and e21_ma_called = 1 and e21_refuse_district != 0
max-visits: 1
priority: 8
on-arrival: {!
Q.e21_refuse_done = 1;
Q.e21_refuse_outcome = 0;
var d = Q.e21_refuse_district;
Q.e21_refuse_name = RG.dname(d);
Q.e21_refuse_trade = RG.TRADES[d];
Q.e21_refuse_saxony = (d == 'saxony') ? 1 : 0;
// how many men the district could bring out
Q.e21_refuse_men = Math.round(Q['district_' + d + '_members'] * 1.5);
!}

= A District Says No

A letter from the [+ e21_refuse_name +] district reaches the Zentrale by the night train. The district will not call [+ e21_refuse_trade +] out. The workers are not ready, the secretary writes, the social democrats would break the strike in a day, and by the end of the week the police would have the name of every communist in the works.

[? if e21_refuse_saxony = 1 : Chemnitz is Brandler's own district, and the letter is signed by men he trained. ?]

- @order: Order them out and replace the leadership.
- @courier: Send a member of the Zentrale to talk them round.
- @respect: Accept their judgement.

@order
subtitle: The district comes out, sullen. Its men will be facing their own workmates at the gates.
on-arrival: {!
var d = Q.e21_refuse_district;
Q.e21_refuse_outcome = 1;
RG.startStrike(d, true);
RG.district(d, {loyalty: -15, repression: 8});
Q.e21_ma_out += Math.round(Q.e21_refuse_men / 2);
Q.e21_ma_rift += 1;
Q.lean_offensive += 2;
Q.crisis_line_1 = 'Out on strike: about ' + Math.round(Q.e21_ma_out / 10) * 10 + ',000 of the ' + Q.e21_ma_need + ',000 it takes';
Q.crisis_line_2 = ['Leuna: occupied by its workers', 'Leuna: held against the police', 'Leuna: stormed on 29 March', 'Leuna: given up without a fight'][Q.e21_leuna];
Q.crisis_line_3 = (Q.e21_ma_rift >= 5) ? 'At the gates: the other workers have turned on us' : ((Q.e21_ma_rift >= 3) ? 'At the gates: worker against worker' : (Q.e21_ma_rift ? 'At the gates: some fights with the men at work' : 'At the gates: no fights yet'));
!}

Two men from the Zentrale take over the district office. The old leadership is suspended, and [+ e21_refuse_trade +] are called out by strangers. About half of them come.

@courier
subtitle: Costs 1 fund. If they are persuaded, the whole district comes out. If not, we have lost a week.
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: We have no money for the journey.
on-arrival: {!
var d = Q.e21_refuse_district;
Q.resources -= 1;
if (Math.random() < 0.3 + Q['district_' + d + '_loyalty'] / 200) {
    Q.e21_refuse_outcome = 3;
    RG.startStrike(d, true);
    Q.e21_ma_out += Q.e21_refuse_men;
    RG.news(Q.e21_refuse_name + ' comes out for Central Germany', 2);
} else {
    Q.e21_refuse_outcome = 4;
}
Q.lean_unionist += 1;
Q.crisis_line_1 = 'Out on strike: about ' + Math.round(Q.e21_ma_out / 10) * 10 + ',000 of the ' + Q.e21_ma_need + ',000 it takes';
Q.crisis_line_2 = ['Leuna: occupied by its workers', 'Leuna: held against the police', 'Leuna: stormed on 29 March', 'Leuna: given up without a fight'][Q.e21_leuna];
Q.crisis_line_3 = (Q.e21_ma_rift >= 5) ? 'At the gates: the other workers have turned on us' : ((Q.e21_ma_rift >= 3) ? 'At the gates: worker against worker' : (Q.e21_ma_rift ? 'At the gates: some fights with the men at work' : 'At the gates: no fights yet'));
!}

A member of the Zentrale spends two days in [+ e21_refuse_name +], at the district office and at the factory gates. [? if e21_refuse_outcome = 3 : The district conference votes to strike by a small majority, and the minority goes out with the majority. ?][? if e21_refuse_outcome = 4 : The district conference hears him out and votes to stay at work. ?]

@respect
subtitle: The district stays at work, its organisation intact. Mansfeld will not thank us.
on-arrival: {!
RG.district(Q.e21_refuse_district, {loyalty: 10});
Q.e21_refuse_outcome = 2;
Q.lean_unionist += 1;
Q.lean_luxemburgist += 1;
!}

The Zentrale writes back that the district is to stay at work and keep its people out of the prisons.
